E AX3054 382-effect-name-reserved.ax:40:9-11 effect-name-reserved "`IO` names a built-in effect, and an effect declared with that name can never be handled: a handle list naming it reads as the built-in" #"`IO` is a built-in effect" ?"choose another name - the built-in effect names are `IO`, `Pure`, `Alloc`, `Mut` and `Div`, and `alloc` is a second spelling of one of them"
